00:10:13.500 --> 00:10:16.970
which means over 20,000
people get notified,

00:10:16.970 --> 00:10:18.730
actually get a pop-up notification

00:10:18.730 --> 00:10:20.330
when I upload a new video.

00:10:20.330 --> 00:10:22.160
And if you're part of
the notification squad,

00:10:22.160 --> 00:10:24.170
there's a way higher chance

00:10:24.170 --> 00:10:26.800
