respond to your comments.

00:10:26.800 --> 00:10:27.970
I can heart your comments.

00:10:27.970 --> 00:10:29.310
I can pin your comments.

00:10:29.310 --> 00:10:31.610
Really exciting things
happening on the channel.

00:10:31.610 --> 00:10:33.530
I'll actually be uploading next week,

00:10:33.530 --> 00:10:35.980
based on "Atomic Habits" by James Clear.

00:10:35.980 --> 00:10:37.120
But that's all for today.

00:10:37.120 --> 00:10:37.980
Thank you for watching

00:10:37.980 --> 00:10:40.256
